# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The one setting the mobile app cannot work without.
#
# The app's own origin on a device is the device itself, so a relative "/api"
# path resolves to the bundled files rather than to your server. Every build
# therefore has to be told where the API actually lives — absolute, with the
# scheme, and with NO trailing slash and NO /api/v1 suffix (that is added for
# you in web/src/lib/config.ts).
#
# Production: your deployed Render service.
VITE_API_URL=https://app.phoenixxedu.com
#
# Testing against the API on your own machine: use the computer's LAN IP, not
# localhost — on a phone, localhost is the phone. Also see CLEARTEXT in README,
# because Android blocks plain http:// by default.
# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.5:4010
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
